- navigating website] A \"Welcome to an educational game platform!\" pop-up appears. The tutor clicks \"Next\" three times, and then clicks \"End Tour\".\nTurn 11. TUTOR: [SCREEN_INTERACTION: tutor - navigating website] The tutor clicks on \"History\", \"Play\", \"Dashboard\", closes a \"an educational game platform News\" pop-up, then clicks \"Favorites\", and \"Homework\" from the left-hand menu.\nThe screen changes to a PDF document titled \"Closing & Future Session\". The page is covered in many black lines drawn by the student, all converging in the center.\nTurn 11. TUTOR: Give me a sec. I think it's not working. Let me figure this out.\nTurn 12. TUTOR: [PAUSE: 29 seconds]\nTurn 12. TUTOR: Okay, now it should work. Let me again share screen. And then\nTurn 13. TUTOR: [SCREEN_UPDATE] The tutor's screen share changes back to the an educational game platform website. The page is titled \"Curriculum\" and is on the \"2nd Grade\" math section. The tutor scrolls down the page, revealing an \"Addition\" section.\nTurn 13. STUDENT: and even, yeah.\nTurn 14. TUTOR: [SCREEN_INTERACTION: tutor - navigating website] The tutor clicks on the \"Odd and Even Numbers\" an educational game platform set.\nTurn 14. TUTOR: [SCREEN_INTERACTION: tutor - navigating website] The screen loads the \"2nd Grade Math: Odd and Even Numbers\" set. The tutor clicks the \"Host Game\" button.\nTurn 14. TUTOR: [SCREEN_INTERACTION: tutor - navigating website] The \"Select Live Game Mode\" screen appears. The tutor scrolls down the list of game modes.\nTurn 14. STUDENT: Where? I'm not doing that.\nTurn 15. TUTOR: [SCREEN_INTERACTION: tutor - navigating website] The tutor continues scrolling through game modes and then selects the \"Classic\" game mode.\nTurn 15. TUTOR: [SCREEN_INTERACTION: tutor - hosting game] The \"Classic Settings\" screen appears. The tutor clicks the \"Host Now\" button.\nTurn 15. TUTOR: [PROBLEM_CHANGE: p1 - 'Blooket Game' (start)] The an educational game platform game lobby